{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-nothing",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 1063,
  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "nothing",
  "ipa": [
    "ˈnʌθɪŋ"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "pron.",
      "zh": "没有东西；没有什么"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Students should learn to protect themselves. "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Nothing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " is more important than life."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "学生要学会保护自己。没有什么比生命更重要。"
    }
  ],
  "proverbs": [
    {
      "en": "Nothing in the world is difficult if you put your heart into it.",
      "zh": "世上无难事，只怕有心人。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "nothing 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握其习惯用法，及比较与 none 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "nothing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " = not anything，意为“没有任何东西；什么也没有”，强调内容，只能指物，泛指。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He felt hungry, but he could find "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "nothing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " to eat in the kitchen."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他饿了，但在厨房里他没有找到吃的东西。（泛指所有吃的东西，不是特指某一种）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "nothing"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的习惯用法有以下 3 点："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) 泛指物；2) 谓语用单数；3) 一般用来回答含 anything 的一般疑问句及 what 引起的特殊问句。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：① — What is in the box?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— Nothing."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——那盒子里有什么？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——什么也没有。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "② — Is there anything in the sky?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— Nothing."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——天空中有什么？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——什么也没有。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "③ — Can you see anything without glasses?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— Nothing."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——你不戴眼镜能看见什么吗？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——啥也看不见。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "none"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " = not any, not one，意为“一点也没有；一个也没有”，即数量概念。既可指人，也可指物，代指上文提到的事物，含特指概念。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He wants me to lend him some money, but I have "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "none"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " at hand."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他想要我借些钱给他，但我现在手头上一个子儿也没有。（特指前面提到的钱）"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "They asked for nine books, but there is/are none in the library at present."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他们需要 9 本书，但目前图书馆一本都没有。（特指前面提到的书）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "none"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的习惯用法有以下 4 点："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) 可与 of 连用；2) 谓语动词用单或复数均可；3) 具体指什么人或物；4) 一般用来回答 How many + "
        },
        {
          "t": "em",
          "v": "n."
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", How much + "
        },
        {
          "t": "em",
          "v": "n."
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "，及含 any + "
        },
        {
          "t": "em",
          "v": "n."
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的疑问句。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：① None of us have/has seen him. 我们都没有见过他。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "② — How many students are there in the room?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— None."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——房间里有多少学生？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——一个也没有。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "③ — How much money do you have on you?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— None."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——你带了多少钱？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——一分没带。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "④ — Is there any water in the thermos?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "— None."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——暖水瓶里有水吗？"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "——没有。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
